<?>        Help                            <m>        Move mail                       <0> Mail
<t>        Read / unread                   <c>        Compose mail                    <2> Contacts
<ctrl-d>   Delete mail                     <n>        New directory
<enter>    Unfold / read                   <space>    Mark mail
<h/H>      HTML / remote                   <ctrl-c>   Twice to quit
</>        Local search                    <ctrl-r>   Sync mail

